
# The `seed hunt` command, expressed in the native `.tree` hook DSL (the
# port of the yargs definition in call/code/line.ts). It exercises the
# extended DSL: `note` (help text), `bind` (default value), and a typed
# optional positional + flags. The bound task is `call-hunt`.

hook hunt
  note <Automated bug-hunt over .tree files>
  task call-hunt
  take glob
    note <Directory to hunt>
  take runs, like number
    note <Fuzz inputs per seed>
    bind 3000
  take seeds, like number
    note <Distinct fuzz seeds>
    bind 4
  take fuzz-timeout, like number
    note <Watchdog seconds per fuzz seed>
    bind 90
  take json, like wave
    note <Machine-readable output>
